  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1385/272/better-item-in-frame-banner-1-png.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>⚠注意：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將正式透過CurseForge、Modrinth與Planet Minecraft上的devHeycronus帳號進行發布與維護。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Better Item in Frame</strong> 是一款《我的世界》材質包，能讓你的物品展示框完全<strong>隱形</strong>，讓展示的武器與工具更加突出、美觀！</p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a>\n<p>此材質包還為放置在展示框中的工具賦予了<strong>3D外觀</strong>，使其看起來更具動態感與真實感&mdash;&mdash;非常適合用於裝飾或炫酷地展示你的頂級裝備。</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>功能特色：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>隱形物品展示框&nbsp;</li>\n<li>展示時工具呈現3D效果 🔧</li>\n<li>完美適用於建築、展區與裝飾 🏠</li>\n</ul>\n<p>讓<strong>Better Item in Frame</strong> 為你的展示增添生機，打造更精緻、沉浸的《我的世界》世界！🌟</p>",
